Codewright CUA commands
==========================================================================
Document/File Commands

Change output name	[Ctrl][Shift][O]
Close document	[Ctrl][-]
Display filename	[Ctrl][F]
Next document	[Ctrl][N]
Open file	[Ctrl][F12]
Open file	[Ctrl][E]
Previous document	[Ctrl][P]
Read file into document	[Ctrl][Shift][F]
Save file	[Shift][F12]
Save file	[Ctrl][W]
Write selection to file	[Ctrl][W]

Cursor Motion/Scrolling Commands =========================================

beginning of line	[Home]
bottom of file	[Ctrl][End]
Cursor left	[Left]
Cursor right	[Right]
end of line	[End]
Go to line (prompt)	[Ctrl][Shift][L]
Go to mark (prompt)	[Ctrl][Shift][B]
Line down	[Down]
Line up	[Up]
Make bottom of win.	[Ctrl][A]
Make top of window	[Ctrl][T]
Make middle of win.	[Ctrl][M]
Page down	[PgDn]
Page up	[PgUp]
Scroll down one line	[Ctrl][Down]
Scroll up one line	[Ctrl][Up]
top of file	[Ctrl][Home]
Word left	[Ctrl][Left]
Word right	[Ctrl][Right]

Editing Commands ==========================================================

Delete character	[Del]
Delete character  left	[Backsp]
Delete line	[Ctrl][D]
Delete to end of line	[Ctrl][Del]
Delete next word	[Shift][Backsp]
Delete previous word	[Ctrl][Backsp]
Indent block	[Tab]
Insert line	[Ctrl][Enter]
Insert next literally	[Ctrl][Q]
Redo	[Alt][Ins]
Redo	[Ctrl][Y]
Undo	[Alt][Backsp]
Undo	[Ctrl][U]
Undo	[Gray *]
Unindent block	[Shift][Tab]

Scrap/Clipboard Commands ================================================

Copy to 	[Ctrl][Ins]
Copy to 	[Ctrl][C]
Copy to 	[Gray +]
Cut to 	[Shift][Del]
Cut to 	[Ctrl][X]
Cut to 	[Gray -]
Paste from 	[Shift][Ins]
Paste from	[Ctrl][V]
Paste from	[Gray /]
Toggle clipb./scrap	[Ctrl][/]

Search/Replace Commands	==================================================

Incremental search	[Ctrl][Shift][I]
Brace kiss	[Ctrl][Shift][K]
Match brace or paren	[Ctrl][ { ]
Quick search	[Ctrl][Shift][Q]
Replace	[Ctrl][R]
Replace again	[Ctrl][Shift][R]
Search	[Ctrl][S]
Search again	[F3]
Search again	[Ctrl][Shift][S]

Selections/Marks Commands =================================================

Begin sel., inclusive	[Ctrl][I]
Begin sel., exclusive	[Ctrl][Z]
Begin selec., column	[Ctrl][B]
Begin selection, line	[Ctrl][L]
Extend selection left	[Shift][Left]
Extend selection right	[Shift][Right]
Extend selection up	[Shift][Up]
Extend sel. down	[Shift][Down]
Extend sel. word left	[Ctrl][Shift][Left]
Extend sel. word right	[Ctrl][Shift][Right]
Extend sel. begin line	[Shift][Home]
Extend sel. end  line	[Shift][End]
Extend sel. beg. document	[Ctrl][Shift][Home]

Extend sel. end document	[Ctrl][Shift][End]
Close/open Selection	[Ctrl][ . ]
Go to mark (prompt)	[Ctrl][Shift][B]
Lower case selec.	[Ctrl][Shift][D]
Upper case selec.	[Ctrl][Shift][U]
Set mark	[Ctrl]n
Slide-in prompt	[Ctrl][>]
Slide-out prompt	[Ctrl][<]

System Commands	=========================================================

API interface	[F9]
API Assistance	[Alt][F1]
Auto indent on/off	[Ctrl][Shift][A]
Compact Mode	[Ctrl][Shift][C]
Compile document	[Ctrl][F10]
Error List	[Ctrl][Shift][Up]
Expand/Col. hidden	[Shift][Enter]
Next error	[Ctrl][Shift][Down]
Help	[F1]
Hex Mode	[Ctrl][Shift][H]
Insert mode on/off	[Ins]
Load recording file	[Ctrl][F7]
Make current	[Ctrl][F9]
Playback keystrokes	[F8]
Play stored keystrokes	[Ctrl][Shift]n
Print version	[Ctrl][Shift][V]

Quit	[Alt][F4]
Record keys toggle	[F7]
Routines	[Ctrl][Shift][G]
Text Mode	[Ctrl][Shift][T]
Wrap paragraph	[Ctrl][Shift][W]
Write recording file	[Ctrl][F8]

Window Commands	======================================================

Close win. & document	[Ctrl][F4]
Close window only	[Ctrl][Shift][-]
Iconify window	[Ctrl][Shift][F4]
Next window	[Ctrl][Shift][N]
Next wind. & document	[Ctrl][F6]
Previous window	[Ctrl][Shift][P]
Toggle visible whspc.	[Ctrl][Shift][X]
Zoom window	[Alt][F2]
